WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,300
Good

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:04,240
Chen Guogong really raised a good son

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,400
Thank you for the compliment

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:08,800
It's better than that good son in your house who's like a dead pig.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,320
The Duke is not here either

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,760
The young master just broke the truth in him

7
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:15,290
I'll go up to your majesty right now

8
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:19,970
Let your majesty see how Chen Guogong teaches his son

9
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:22,970
Remember to explain everything clearly

10
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:27,580
So as not to be guilty of deceiving the emperor, you are so brave

11
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:36,570
I'm timid

12
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:39,610
If you're scared, come and take action. Just wait.

13
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:42,530
I will play whatever I want

14
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:58,270
If you let my son go, I will take him away, and I can give you money. If you dream, I will give you five hundred taels.

15
00:00:58,470 --> 00:01:03,270
Mr. Hou, this money bag looks very straight, let people loosen it.

16
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:08,330
I will report this matter to His Majesty

17
00:01:08,490 --> 00:01:09,650
Mr. Hou, please feel free to go.

18
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,800
Thank you, brother, when you are free later

19
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,360
Come and sit at home often
